Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-bool
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable pruning?
 Save storage space by pruning (deleting) old blocks 
 and keeping only a limited copy of the blockchain.

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune
Type: string
_Description: Value for pruning (must be at least 550 or 0/1) in MiB:
 0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC, 
 >=550 = automatically prune block files to stay under the target size in MiB

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-bool-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure prune
 Couldn't configure the prune setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-fail
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for prune
 Prune must be 0, 1 or superior or equal to 550

Template: bitcoin-knots/txindex
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable transaction index?
 This is required for electrum servers and various other software

Template: bitcoin-knots/txindex-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure txindex
 Couldn't configure the txindex setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/dbcache
Type: string
Default: 450
_Description: Value for dbcache (must be at least 4) in MiB:
 A larger cache can speed up the initial synchronization of your Bitcoin node,  
 but after the initial sync is complete, a larger cache value does not 
 significantly improve performance and may use more RAM than needed.

Template: bitcoin-knots/dbcache-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure dbcache
 Couldn't configure the dbcache setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/dbcache-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for dbcache
 dbcache must be superior or equal to 4

Template: bitcoin-knots/bitcoinconf
Type: error
_Description: bitcoin.conf file missing, unable to interactively configure bitcoind
 the file /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf is missing, debconf expect this file to 
 interactively configure bitcoind.

Template: bitcoin-knots/pruneduringinit
Type: string
Default: -1
_Description: Value for pruneduringinit (must be at least 550 or -1/0/1) in MiB:
 -1 = same as prune, 0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC, 
 >=550 = automatically prune block files to stay under the target size in MiB

Template: bitcoin-knots/pruneduringinit-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for pruneduringinit
 Pruneduringinit must be -1, 0, 1 or superior or equal to 550

Template: bitcoin-knots/pruneduringinit-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure pruneduringinit
 Couldn't configure the pruneduringinit setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcthreads
Type: string
Default: 64
_Description: Value for rpcthreads (must be superior or equal to 0):
 Set the number of threads to service RPC calls

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcthreads-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for rpcthreads
 rpcthreads must be superior or equal to 0

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcthreads-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure rpcthreads
 Couldn't configure the rpcthreads setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcworkqueue
Type: string
Default: 64
_Description: Value for rpcworkqueue (must be superior or equal to 0):
 Set the maximum depth of the work queue to service RPC calls

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcworkqueue-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for rpcworkqueue
 rpcworkqueue must be superior or equal to 0

Template: bitcoin-knots/rpcworkqueue-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure rpcworkqueue
 Couldn't configure the rpcworkqueue setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockprioritysize
Type: string
Default: 0
_Description: Value for blockprioritysize:
 Set maximum size of high-priority/low-fee transactions in bytes

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockprioritysize-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockprioritysize
 blockprioritysize must be between 0 and 4000000

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockprioritysize-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockprioritysize
 Couldn't configure the blockprioritysize setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockmaxsize
Type: string
Default: 3985000
_Description: Value for blockmaxsize:
 Set maximum block size in bytes

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockmaxsize-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockmaxsize
 blockmaxsize must be between 0 and 3985000

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockmaxsize-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockmaxsize
 Couldn't configure the blockmaxsize setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockmaxweight
Type: string
Default: 3985000
_Description: Value for blockmaxweight:
 Set maximum BIP141 block weight

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockmaxweight-wrong
Type: note
