 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxmempool
Type: string
Default: 1000
_Description: Value for maxmempool:
 Keep the transaction memory pool below <n> megabytes

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxmempool-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for maxmempool
 maxmempool must be superior or equal to 5

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxmempool-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure maxmempool
 Couldn't configure the maxmempool setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxn
Type: string
Default: 1000000
_Description: Value for blockreconstructionextratxn:
 Extra transactions to keep in memory for compact block reconstructions

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxn-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockreconstructionextratxn
 blockreconstructionextratxn must be superior or equal to 0

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxn-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockreconstructionextratxn
 Couldn't configure the blockreconstructionextratxn setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxnsize
Type: string
Default: 100
_Description: Value for blockreconstructionextratxnsize:
 Upper limit of memory usage (in megabytes) for keeping extra
 transactions in memory for compact block reconstructions

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxnsize-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for blockreconstructionextratxnsize
 blockreconstructionextratxnsize must be superior or equal to 0

Template: bitcoin-knots/blockreconstructionextratxnsize-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blockreconstructionextratxnsize
 Couldn't configure the blockreconstructionextratxnsize setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxorphantx
Type: string
Default: 50000
_Description: Value for maxorphantx:
 Keep at most <n> unconnectable transactions in memory

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxorphantx-wrong
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for maxorphantx
 maxorphantx must be superior or equal to 0

Template: bitcoin-knots/maxorphantx-fail
